<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GF Prop cautions further.</title>
<headline>GF Prop cautions further.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Fields Property Co Ltd said on Wednesday due diligence exercises were underway regarding the process for the disposal by the principal shareholder of its shares in the company.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
